  "mechanical_assembly": "Opposite contacts reflect measured leg-only selections centered below each stance, preserving staff/trowel/hammer/cape pixels outside the selection; independent profile-B source legs. Companion rest head/torso/satchel fixed, selected model-authored upper/forearm joints registered with source-relative transverse width, hands/orbs uniform rotation+scale; no painted pixel fills or mirrored costumes. Alethea windup upper-arm mask excludes detached spill.",
  "palette_conversion": "Alpha128; nearest neighbor; median-cut15 plus kmeans5, GBA precision; x12 extra weight only for saturated hue accents or neutral lights each at <=3 percent opaque coverage, never broad red robes; walkers map to byte-identical engine shared palettes.",
